Description:
Do you think some animations take too long? This mod speeds them up to take less than a second each, and you can optionally configure the speed for each animation.

![](https://i.imgur.com/suHzq2E.png)  

1. [Install the latest version of SMAPI](https://smapi.io).
2. Install the mod through ModDrop (or unzip the download into `Stardew Valley/Mods`).
3. Run the game using SMAPI.

![](https://i.imgur.com/M7KlO44.png)  

* Compatible with...
   * Stardew Valley 1.5 or later;
   * Linux, macOS, and Windows;
   * single-player and multiplayer (see [multiplayer compatibility notes](https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/FastAnimations#compatibility)).
* No known mod conflicts.

Pairs well with:  
* [Skip Intro](https://www.moddrop.com/stardew-valley/mods/606601)﻿ to skip the game's launch credits.
* [Tool Charging](https://smapi.io/mods#Tool_Charging)﻿ to use upgraded tool areas more quickly.

![](https://i.imgur.com/j6fpZ3A.png)  

The mod automatically speeds up...
* breaking geodes;
* casino slots;
* drinking & eating (optionally skip confirm dialogue);
* harvesting crops;
* milking;
* mounting/dismouting horses;
* shearing;
* taking the bus to/from the desert;
* title menu animations;
* fishing _(disabled by default)_;
* falling trees _(disabled by default)_.
* swinging tools/weapons _(disabled by default)_.

You can optionally change how the mod works:

* [edit the mod settings](https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/FastAnimations#configure) to change the speed of each animation.;
* download the [optional file on Nexus](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1089?tab=files) if you only want fast geodes;
* with [Generic Mod Config Menu](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098) installed, you can also configure it through the ⚙ button on the title screen (see [example screenshot](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/stable/FastAnimations/docs/screenshots/generic-config-menu.png)).

![](https://i.imgur.com/ccJ4SPZ.png)  

